   "announcedAt": "2025-10-09T01:29:29.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "We have released Patch Ver.1.0.18 with the following update",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "・Added \"한국어 (Korean)\" to the language settings.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "You can now enjoy “Yohane the Parhelion - NUMAZU in the MIRAGE -” in Korean!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "All in-game text — including battles, stories, and cards — is now available in Korean!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Whether you’re a Korean player or learning the language, you can now enjoy an even smoother gameplay experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44639041/e185a4914737f9a7fbb9d8043d5d702441f83c8e.jpg\"]You can change the language from the “Settings” menu in the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
