  {
   "id": "yohane-the-parhelion-numazu-in-the-mirage-267625@1.0.4",
   "gameId": "yohane-the-parhelion-numazu-in-the-mirage-267625",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.0.4",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-02-29T08:32:16.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Announcement",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・We have released Patch Ver1.0.4 to address the following issue.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix Details",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "・We have made adjustments so that the synchronization of save data with Steam Cloud now operates correctly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "・The details are described below.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・We have made corrections to areas believed to be causing issues with the game not starting properly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Regarding Steam Cloud Saves",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "There has been an issue where save data was not properly syncing with Steam Cloud, which has been addressed in the update to Ver.1.0.4.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "After this update, save data synchronization with Steam Cloud will function properly. For those playing \"Yohane the Parhelion - NUMAZU in the MIRAGE -\" on multiple PCs, the following message may appear when starting the game:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "\"Gameplay Data has been found on this PC. Would you like to continue the game with this data?\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "If this message appears, please check each data and select the data you wish to play with.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "・For those who wish to play with data saved on their PC : Please select \"Continuing the game with the data on this PC.\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "・For those who wish to play with data from Steam Cloud : Please select \"Continuing the game with data from Steam Cloud.\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "This message will not appear for those who play \"Yohane the Parhelion - NUMAZU in the MIRAGE -\" on only one PC.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Additional Information",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "・We will continue to address other reported bugs and issues as we move forward.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
